  "name": "Lokalise - probe key CREATE v2 (Mobitrace)",
  "description": "Creates one throwaway key in Mobitrace with an EN source only, tagged zz_temp_probe, to fire the external automation webhook and validate the TM-then-AI fill end to end. key_name sent as a string, which POST /keys requires.",
